\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My spirit longs for Thee,
\par Within my troubled breast,
\par Unworthy though I be
\par Of so divine a guest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Of so divine a guest
\par Unworthy though I be,
\par Yet has my heart no rest
\par Unless it come from Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Unless it come from Thee,
\par In vain I look around;
\par In all that I can see
\par No rest is to be found.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. No rest is to be found
\par But in Thy blessed love;
\par O let my wish be crowned,
\par And send it from above!
\par                             Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
